"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, Cherokee County has a rain record from 1951 to 2025, 75 years in all. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years. In 2025 the middle ran 181% of normal in March to April and 42% in November to December. Grid 20240 had its driest year in 1963, at 46% of normal.</p>"}
